## 15. Success Metrics

- **Activation:** % of signed-up users who complete onboarding (target job + resume/GitHub connected) within their first session.
- **Depth of use:** Average number of roadmap items marked "In Progress" or "Completed" per active user.
- **Evidence growth:** % of users whose Evidence Strength score increases within 14 days of connecting GitHub.
- **Trust/explainability:** % of skill statuses that include at least one visible evidence citation.
- **Retention:** % of users who return to the dashboard after their first GitHub sync-triggered score change.

